{"id":"rayos","lemma":"rayos","pos":"intj","rank":1168,"glosses":["dang it, goddammit, heck"],"ipa":"/ˈraʝos/","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué rayos es esto?","en":"What in the world is this?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598563","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"this"}]},{"text":"Los rayos pueden ser peligrosos.","en":"Lightning can be dangerous.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69906","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"perilous, dangerous","l":"peligroso"}]},{"text":"Pueden haber rayos durante una tormenta.","en":"Lightning can occur during a storm.","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to have"},null,{"g":"during, in, over"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"storm"}]},{"text":"Huele a mil rayos aquí.","en":"It really stinks in here.","words":[{"g":"to smell","l":"oler"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"thousand"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"No me dan miedo los rayos.","en":"I'm not afraid of lightning.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"dan"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}